=== narrow ===

 what does the accented file say? 🖊


Reading the file with the combining
marks in its name.

The name is written café rather than
café, so the accent is a mark of its
own.

A family 👨‍👩‍👧 is one glyph joined from
several, and a heart ❤️ asks to be drawn
in colour.

Combining marks pile up too: á̂̃̄ is one
letter under four of them.

A styled wide rune has nowhere to go in
one column: 日本 in code, 中文 in bold.

And a result that came back with Windows
line endings:
one
two
three
